  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-12T05:41:51.789718Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T15:39:54.124221Z",
  "totalBlocks": 9,
  "translatedBlocks": 9,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a42228caaad18944",
      "translationZh": "Perplexity 使用 Astra 来撰写通信、修改软件以及监控生产系统，并且相比早期模型，检查频率要低得多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c50c5b025b9627a",
      "translationZh": "作为一个由 AI 驱动的答案引擎，Perplexity 深度专注于搜索和准确性。其处理大量信息的能力至关重要。Johnny Ho，联合创始人兼首席战略官，观察到每当模型在编写代码方面变得更好时，Perplexity 的搜索引擎也会随之改进。它能够编写更好的程序来搜索网络和内部信息，并非常简洁地进行总结。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37fdb60aa8ca96fa",
      "translationZh": "但根据 Johnny 的说法，真正的挑战在于将这些信息方面应用到实际系统中。使用 GPT‑6 Astra 可以使这变得更容易。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eb00be3ac41915f",
      "translationZh": "“我们可以让模型撰写通信、编辑实际系统，并以之前几代无法实现的方式监控我们的生产软件。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbf4efa53d626793",
      "translationZh": "—Johnny Ho，联合创始人兼首席战略官，Perplexity",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "979696d9b03205ca",
      "translationZh": "让模型来进行测试",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "354cb72e8a350494",
      "translationZh": "对 Johnny 来说，AI 最有用的应用之一是测试代码。由于手动测试时间有限，他让 GPT‑6 Astra 构建一个围绕应用程序的小型测试程序。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97d7fa44904666ce",
      "translationZh": "模型生成的响应类似于另一项服务会发送的响应，例如语言模型 API 或连接器。通过替代这些服务，模型可以检查应用程序的响应情况，并从头到尾测试整个工作流。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "902814f4af10d8d1",
      "translationZh": "我们实际上能够完全信任它来处理完整的端到端系统，并且相比之前几代模型，检查它的频率要低得多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
